<title>USA: Travelers Property Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Travelers Property Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Conn. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.68		    $0.33</p>
<p> Net		 273,100		  98,000</p>
<p> Revs		2,431,300		1,151,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  399,300		  294,500</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Oper shr $0.67 vs $0.27 before realized investment gains $0.01 vs $0.06.</p>
<p>Net investment gains $5.2 million vs $17.2 million.</p>
<p>Net premiums written $2.11 bln vs $1.88 bln.</p>
<p>Full name is Travelers Property Casualty.</p>
